  "details": "When I went to change the opacity of my mic today it felt like there was little to no change unless changed drastically, More importantly too me I see that there is two sliders  for opacity but I noticed that when I change the opacity of the mic it will also change the opacity of my invites, requests, etc which I don't want as low as my mic, the mic I like to keep nearly invisible so I can see when its on or off and that's about it really, but when I have it that low, i miss a lot of invites or requests because I just cant see them.  It would be nice to have a little more control or another slider that allows me to have one set lower then the other.",
